OL,4,G0100FThe Atlantic Records Story
OL,5,     GJohnnie Walker tells the story of
OL,6,     Gthe Atlantic Records label,
OL,7,     Gfocusing on Solomon Burke, Wilson
OL,8,     GPickett and Dusty Springfield.
OL,9,G0200FThe Atlantic Records Story
OL,10,     GJohnnie Walker looks at how
OL,11,     GAretha Franklin, the queen of
OL,12,     Gsoul, got signed by Atlantic
OL,13,     GRecords, making her a global
OL,14,     Gsuperstar and a key voice of the
OL,15,     Gcivil rights movement.
